  "description": "AFFECTED1 AUTHOR CANDIDATE ONLY: origin-centered radius-five circle on the original 38 by 27 half-unit grid, with eight labelled locations, three solid radial segments and three perpendicular projections, including exterior D. Independently observed original pixels establish endpoint roles and visible solid ink; the separately overlaid projection stroke style cannot be distinguished from the grid and remains unknown. No hidden dashed style is certified or invented. Reuses the actual historical cap1-HOLD spec. Only projection emphasis changes: solid muted 2.5 px over the pale grid is a modern presentation choice, not a newly resolved source-style fact. Historical HOLD evidence remains immutable, while this candidate is prepared for affected-only independent review under the human visible-ink instruction. Numeric sample positions remain structural measurements, not extra printed givens. Source inventory seal: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n7-figures3695-AFFECTED1/sourceinventory.record; SHA-256 dce1e711d85d15a5b2ef748311947c3e68032c2dc69af00e9205fd60eda6cb3c. Current context: /Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-3695/lemmadeck/.tmp/resume182-6-8a-n7-figure-context3695-AFFECTED1/fig-15.context.json; SHA-256 af4fe2c4e0918acd19312009d08215961f514c8f22a9e072419ab19ad8dd8e48. No candidate visual inspection, independent review, promotion or lesson approval. REPAIR1 after the preserved first current render FAIL: move only the A, B1 and D1 endpoint labels to clear the circle and nearby point footprints under the current label-placement API. This is the single bounded affected endpoint/projection layout repair. Mathematical geometry, source text, guide style and source facts are unchanged.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-15.png",
      "sha256": "e5b5a48fa35691a096dc709d2860c9f266b605c112e920a42933e457a5f72595"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "我们来看图15，图中画出了圆心在坐标原点、半径为5个单位长的圆周. 我们来求图象是这个圆周的方程."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "实际上，设点$B(x_1,y_1)$在圆内（参看图15），那么$|OB|<5$，$x_1^2+y_1^2<5^2$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "于是，当且仅当坐标为$x$和$y$的点位于圆心在坐标原点、半径为5个单位长的圆周上时，等式$x^2+y^2=5^2$成立. 因此，图15中画出的圆周是方程$x^2+y^2=5^2$的图象."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "图14"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "图15"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "设点$A(x,y)$是这个圆周上不在两个坐标轴上的任意一点. 那么，在直角三角形$OAA_1$中，根据勾股定理得：\n$|OA_1|^2+|AA_1|^2=|OA|^2$.显然，$|OA_1|^2=x^2$，$|AA_1|^2=y^2$，$|OA|^2=5^2$. 于是，圆周上不在两个坐标轴上的任意一点的坐标满足方程$x^2+y^2=5^2$： （1）"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c2-s1-n7",
        "text": "容易验证，圆周与$x$轴和$y$轴的每一个交点的坐标也满足方程（1）. 例如，把点$C(0,-5)$的坐标代入方程（1），得到真等式：\n$0^2+(-5)^2=5^2$."
      }
    ],
